---@field MySQLCatalogSource? aws.glue.MySQLCatalogSource Specifies a MySQL data source in the Glue Data Catalog.
---@field OracleSQLCatalogSource? aws.glue.OracleSQLCatalogSource Specifies an Oracle data source in the Glue Data Catalog.
---@field PostgreSQLCatalogSource? aws.glue.PostgreSQLCatalogSource Specifies a PostgresSQL data source in the Glue Data Catalog.
---@field MicrosoftSQLServerCatalogTarget? aws.glue.MicrosoftSQLServerCatalogTarget Specifies a target that uses Microsoft SQL.
---@field MySQLCatalogTarget? aws.glue.MySQLCatalogTarget Specifies a target that uses MySQL.
---@field OracleSQLCatalogTarget? aws.glue.OracleSQLCatalogTarget Specifies a target that uses Oracle SQL.
---@field PostgreSQLCatalogTarget? aws.glue.PostgreSQLCatalogTarget Specifies a target that uses Postgres SQL.
---@field Route? aws.glue.Route Specifies a route node that directs data to different output paths based on defined filtering conditions.
---@field DynamicTransform? aws.glue.DynamicTransform Specifies a custom visual transform created by a user.
---@field EvaluateDataQuality? aws.glue.EvaluateDataQuality Specifies your data quality evaluation criteria.
