---@field WorkerType? aws.glue.WorkerType|string The type of predefined worker that is allocated when a job runs. Accepts a value of G.1X, G.2X, G.4X, G.8X, G.12X, G.16X, R.1X, R.2X, R.4X, or R.8X for Spark jobs. Accepts the value Z.2X for Ray notebooks.
