---Specifies connection options for DynamoDB ELT (Extract, Load, Transform) operations. This structure contains configuration parameters for connecting to and extracting data from DynamoDB tables using the ELT connector.
---@class aws.glue.DDBELTConnectionOptions
---@field DynamodbExport? aws.glue.DdbExportType|string Specifies the export type for DynamoDB data extraction. This parameter determines how data is exported from the DynamoDB table during the ELT process.
---@field DynamodbUnnestDDBJson? aws.glue.BooleanValue A boolean value that specifies whether to unnest DynamoDB JSON format during data extraction. When set to true, the connector will flatten nested JSON structures from DynamoDB items. When set to false, the original DynamoDB JSON structure is preserved.
