---The response for the data quality result.
---@class aws.glue.GetDataQualityResultResponse
---@field ResultId? aws.glue.HashString A unique result ID for the data quality result.
---@field EvaluationRunMode? aws.glue.DataQualityEvaluationRunMode How the evaluation run that produced the result started: ON_DEMAND for a run started by StartDataQualityRulesetEvaluationRun, or EVALUATION_CONFIG for a run started by a data quality evaluation configuration. Not returned for results that no evaluation run produced, such as results from any ETL job.
---@field DataQualityEvaluationConfig? aws.glue.NameString The name of the data quality evaluation configuration that started the evaluation run, returned when EvaluationRunMode is EVALUATION_CONFIG.
---@field ProfileId? aws.glue.HashString The Profile ID for the data quality result.
---@field Score? aws.glue.GenericBoundedDouble An aggregate data quality score. Represents the ratio of rules that passed to the total number of rules.
---@field DataSource? aws.glue.DataSource The table associated with the data quality result, if any.
---@field RulesetName? aws.glue.NameString The name of the ruleset associated with the data quality result.
---@field EvaluationContext? aws.glue.GenericString In the context of a job in Glue Studio, each node in the canvas is typically assigned some sort of name and data quality nodes will have names. In the case of multiple nodes, the evaluationContext can differentiate the nodes.
---@field StartedOn? aws.glue.Timestamp The date and time when the run for this data quality result started.
---@field CompletedOn? aws.glue.Timestamp The date and time when the run for this data quality result was completed.
---@field JobName? aws.glue.NameString The job name associated with the data quality result, if any.
---@field JobRunId? aws.glue.HashString The job run ID associated with the data quality result, if any.
---@field RulesetEvaluationRunId? aws.glue.HashString The unique run ID associated with the ruleset evaluation.
---@field RuleResults? aws.glue.DataQualityRuleResults A list of DataQualityRuleResult objects representing the results for each rule.
---@field AnalyzerResults? aws.glue.DataQualityAnalyzerResults A list of DataQualityAnalyzerResult objects representing the results for each analyzer.
---@field Observations? aws.glue.DataQualityObservations A list of DataQualityObservation objects representing the anomaly detection observations generated after evaluating the rules and analyzers.
---@field AggregatedMetrics? aws.glue.DataQualityAggregatedMetrics A summary of DataQualityAggregatedMetrics objects showing the total counts of processed rows and rules, including their pass/fail statistics based on row-level results.

