---@field EvaluationRunMode? aws.glue.DataQualityEvaluationRunMode How the evaluation run that produced the result started: ON_DEMAND for a run started by StartDataQualityRulesetEvaluationRun, or EVALUATION_CONFIG for a run started by a data quality evaluation configuration. Not returned for results that no evaluation run produced, such as results from any ETL job.
---@field DataQualityEvaluationConfig? aws.glue.NameString The name of the data quality evaluation configuration that started the evaluation run, returned when EvaluationRunMode is EVALUATION_CONFIG.
---@field DataSource? aws.glue.DataSource The table associated with the data quality result, if any.
