---@field Tags? aws.glue.PublishDataQualityResultTags A map of tags associated with the data quality result.
---@field ExecutionStartedOn? aws.glue.Timestamp The date and time when this data quality run started.
---@field ExecutionCompletedOn? aws.glue.Timestamp The date and time when this data quality run completed.
---@field ResultPublishedOn? aws.glue.Timestamp The date and time when this data quality result was published.
---@field Score? aws.glue.GenericBoundedDouble An aggregate data quality score. Represents the ratio of rules that passed to the total number of rules.
---@field RuleResults? aws.glue.DataQualityRuleResults A list of DataQualityRuleResult objects representing the results for each rule.
---@field AnalyzerResults? aws.glue.DataQualityAnalyzerResults A list of DataQualityAnalyzerResult objects representing the results for each analyzer.
---@field Observations? aws.glue.DataQualityObservations A list of DataQualityObservation objects representing the anomaly detection observations generated after evaluating the rules and analyzers.
