---@field RulesetName? aws.glue.NameString The name of a Data Quality Definition Language (DQDL) ruleset, containing analyzers, rules, or both, to evaluate tables with. You create the ruleset using the CreateDataQualityRuleset API. Specify either RulesetName or ManagedRulesetName, not both.
