---@field Role? aws.glue.RoleString The IAM role that evaluations assume. You can specify the role name or the role Amazon Resource Name (ARN). The role needs the trust policy and permissions described for CreateDataQualityEvaluationConfig.
---@field NumberOfWorkers? aws.glue.NullableInteger The number of G.1X workers to be used in the run. The default is 5.
---@field Timeout? aws.glue.Timeout The timeout for a run in minutes. This is the maximum time that a run can consume resources before it is terminated and enters TIMEOUT status. The default is 2,880 minutes (48 hours).
---@field AdditionalRunOptions? aws.glue.DataQualityEvaluationConfigAdditionalRunOptions Additional run options you can specify for an evaluation run.
---@field AdditionalDataSources? aws.glue.DataSourceMap A map of reference strings to additional data sources you can specify for an evaluation run.

