---@class aws.glue.WorkflowRun
---@field Name? aws.glue.NameString Name of the workflow that was run.
---@field WorkflowRunId? aws.glue.IdString The ID of this workflow run.
---@field PreviousRunId? aws.glue.IdString The ID of the previous workflow run.
---@field WorkflowRunProperties? aws.glue.WorkflowRunProperties The workflow run properties which were set during the run.
---@field StartedOn? aws.glue.TimestampValue The date and time when the workflow run was started.
---@field CompletedOn? aws.glue.TimestampValue The date and time when the workflow run completed.
---@field Status? aws.glue.WorkflowRunStatus The status of the workflow run.
---@field ErrorMessage? aws.glue.ErrorString This error message describes any error that may have occurred in starting the workflow run. Currently the only error message is "Concurrent runs exceeded for workflow: foo."
---@field Statistics? aws.glue.WorkflowRunStatistics The statistics of the run.
---@field Graph? aws.glue.WorkflowGraph The graph representing all the Glue components that belong to the workflow as nodes and directed connections between them as edges.
---@field StartingEventBatchCondition? aws.glue.StartingEventBatchCondition The batch condition that started the workflow run.

---@alias aws.glue.WorkflowRunProperties { [string]: aws.glue.GenericString }

---Workflow run statistics provides statistics about the workflow run.
---@class aws.glue.WorkflowRunStatistics
---@field TotalActions aws.glue.IntegerValue Total number of Actions in the workflow run.
---@field TimeoutActions aws.glue.IntegerValue Total number of Actions that timed out.
---@field FailedActions aws.glue.IntegerValue Total number of Actions that have failed.
---@field StoppedActions aws.glue.IntegerValue Total number of Actions that have stopped.
---@field SucceededActions aws.glue.IntegerValue Total number of Actions that have succeeded.
---@field RunningActions aws.glue.IntegerValue Total number Actions in running state.
---@field ErroredActions aws.glue.IntegerValue Indicates the count of job runs in the ERROR state in the workflow run.
---@field WaitingActions aws.glue.IntegerValue Indicates the count of job runs in WAITING state in the workflow run.

---@alias aws.glue.WorkflowRunStatus "RUNNING"|"COMPLETED"|"STOPPING"|"STOPPED"|"ERROR"

---@alias aws.glue.WorkflowRuns aws.glue.WorkflowRun[]

---@alias aws.glue.Workflows aws.glue.Workflow[]

---A classifier for XML content.
---@class aws.glue.XMLClassifier
---@field Name aws.glue.NameString The name of the classifier.
---@field Classification aws.glue.Classification An identifier of the data format that the classifier matches.
---@field CreationTime? aws.glue.Timestamp The time that this classifier was registered.
---@field LastUpdated? aws.glue.Timestamp The time that this classifier was last updated.
---@field Version aws.glue.VersionId The version of this classifier.
---@field RowTag? aws.glue.RowTag The XML tag designating the element that contains each record in an XML document being parsed. This can't identify a self-closing element (closed by />). An empty row element that contains only attributes can be parsed as long as it ends with a closing tag (for example, is okay, but is not).

